{"id":"cbt_001","name":"五阶段正常走完","note":"情境→想法→检验→行动→确认→复盘→总结","steps":[{"action":"message","text":"下周组会要汇报，一想到就手心出汗","expectStage":"COGNITIVE_EXTRACTION"},{"action":"message","text":"我肯定会搞砸","expectStage":"COGNITIVE_REVIEW"},{"action":"message","text":"前三次有两次其实还行，组长只提了数据口径","expectStage":"INTERVENTION_DECISION"},{"action":"message","text":"提前写下三条具体预测，会后逐条核对","expectStage":"BEHAVIORAL_EXPERIMENT"},{"action":"message","text":"汇报前把三条预测写在便签上","expectStage":"ACTION_CONFIRM","expectStatus":"awaiting_confirmation"},{"action":"confirm","expectStage":"ACTION_REVIEW"},{"action":"message","text":"写了，汇报比想象中顺，大家照常问口径","expectStage":"SESSION_SUMMARY","expectStatus":"ended"}]}
{"id":"cbt_002","name":"确认是中断点：普通消息推不动","note":"awaiting_confirmation 时再发消息，只能拿到提醒，不能进复盘","steps":[{"action":"message","text":"下周组会要汇报"},{"action":"message","text":"我肯定会搞砸"},{"action":"message","text":"前两次其实还行"},{"action":"message","text":"写下三条预测，会后核对"},{"action":"message","text":"汇报前写在便签上","expectStage":"ACTION_CONFIRM"},{"action":"message","text":"我直接跳过确认行不行","expectStage":"ACTION_CONFIRM","expectStatus":"awaiting_confirmation"},{"action":"confirm","expectStage":"ACTION_REVIEW"}]}
{"id":"cbt_003","name":"改说法后确认","note":"确认时可以带 thought，落库的是用户自己改的那句","steps":[{"action":"message","text":"下周组会要汇报"},{"action":"message","text":"我肯定会搞砸"},{"action":"message","text":"前两次其实还行"},{"action":"message","text":"写下三条预测，会后核对"},{"action":"message","text":"汇报前写在便签上","expectStage":"ACTION_CONFIRM"},{"action":"confirm","thought":"我可能会紧张，但不等于一定会搞砸","expectStage":"ACTION_REVIEW","expectConfirmed":"我可能会紧张，但不等于一定会搞砸"}]}
{"id":"cbt_004","name":"敏感词整句拦下且不推进","note":"命中 block 词，流程停在原阶段","steps":[{"action":"message","text":"想加微信详聊","expectStage":"PROBLEM_IDENTIFICATION","expectStatus":"content_blocked"},{"action":"message","text":"最近工作压力很大","expectStage":"COGNITIVE_EXTRACTION"}]}
{"id":"cbt_005","name":"危机表达立即暂停","note":"命中安全规则，转介且不再推进","steps":[{"action":"message","text":"最近总是觉得自己做什么都不行"},{"action":"message","text":"我真的不想活了","expectStage":"SAFETY_HOLD","expectStatus":"safety_hold"},{"action":"message","text":"我缓过来了，继续吧","expectStage":"SAFETY_HOLD","expectStatus":"safety_hold"}]}
{"id":"cbt_006","name":"低自评只进关注，不暂停","note":"情绪 2 分是 watch，不是 hold","steps":[{"action":"mood","score":2,"expectSafetyStatus":"watch","expectStage":"PROBLEM_IDENTIFICATION"},{"action":"message","text":"最近睡不好","expectStage":"COGNITIVE_EXTRACTION","expectStatus":"awaiting_user"}]}
{"id":"cbt_007","name":"超长消息被拒","note":"服务端硬上限 2000 字","steps":[{"action":"message","text":"很长","repeat":2100,"expectHttp":422,"expectStage":"PROBLEM_IDENTIFICATION"}]}
{"id":"cbt_008","name":"提前结束","note":"点门离开后状态是 ended，后续消息不再推进","steps":[{"action":"message","text":"最近工作压力很大"},{"action":"end","expectStatus":"ended"},{"action":"message","text":"我还想说","expectStage":"ENDED","expectStatus":"ended"}]}
